OL,3,ADaniel Thomas admits boat criminal
OL,4,Adamage in channel
OL,5,
OL,6,FThomas, whose address was withheld by
OL,7,Fthe court at a previous hearing,
OL,8,Fadmitted using a knife on the dinghy
OL,9,Fwhich had French personnel on board. He
OL,10,Fwill be sentenced at the same court on
OL,11,F18 November.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
