OL,3,AOne killed and four injured in
OL,4,AWashington DC shooting as police say
OL,5,Asuspect has been 'contained'
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne person has been killed and four
OL,8,Fmore injured in a shooting in
OL,9,FWashington DC, police say
OL,11,FJeffrey W Carroll, the interim chief of
OL,12,FWashington DC police, says one of the
OL,13,Fvictims is in a critical condition and
OL,14,Fthe others have non life-threatening
OL,15,Finjuries
OL,17,FMeanwhile, Carroll says the suspect - a
OL,18,Fwhite male - has been "contained" after
OL,19,Fbarricading himself inside a building
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
