OL,3,AUkraine says military Starlink
OL,4,Adisrupted again as US envoys meet Putin
OL,5,Ain Moscow
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky has said
OL,8,FUkraine's military is again facing
OL,9,F"systematic" restrictions to Starlink's
OL,10,Fmilitary-grade service, Starshield,
OL,11,Fmeaning Kyiv is struggling to intercept
OL,12,FRussian jet-powered drones.
OL,14,FIt came as US envoys Jared Kushner and
OL,15,FSteve Witkoff met Russian President
OL,16,FVladimir Putin in Moscow, a day after
OL,17,Fthe latest talks aimed at ending the
OL,18,Fwar in Ukraine wrapped up in Abu Dhabi.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
